[I] A backend utility to get CDDB discid information from a CD-ROM disc

[T] cd-discid reads the table of contents of a CD-ROM and prints its CDDB
[T] disc ID, the number of tracks, the frame offsets of the tracks and the
[T] disc length. It was originally written for abcde but can be used by any
[T] program needing CDDB data.

[U] https://github.com/taem/cd-discid/

[A] Cd-discid Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/base
[F] CROSS

